Package: MRIcrotome
Type: Package
Title: Visualization Tools for 3D Volumes
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Jason", "Lerch", email = "jason.lerch@sickkids.ca",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds publication-ready figures from 3D volumes such as MRI
    scans. A figure is described as a pipeline: a series of slices through a
    volume, an anatomical background, statistical or label overlays, contours,
    titles, colour bar legends and slice indicators. Figures are drawn with
    'grid' graphics, so they can also be returned as grobs and combined with
    other 'grid' output.
